# Base URL of the V.SMART API (V.SMART/V.SMART.Api).
#
# DELIBERATELY EMPTY. There is no default and no fallback: a missing value must
# fail loudly. The Angular pilot hardcodes http://localhost:5144 in BOTH
# environment.ts:4 and environment.prod.ts:3 -- its production build points at
# localhost. Do not reproduce that.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
